+
+- **Finding:** in v4.0.0, profiles 0–2 use only 3×3, 3×5, and 5×3 rectangles, while held-out profile 3 uniquely introduces 5×5. The lesson-local rule “apply the cross only to dimensions observed in demonstrations” fits all three demonstrations and changes the query at nine cells.
