+- **Repair:** v4.0.1 changes the 8×10 profile from a 3×3 secondary rectangle to a separated 5×5 rectangle. Each of the four supported dimension pairs now appears in at least two schedule profiles, so every three-of-four demonstration set teaches every dimension used by its held-out query.
